      "message": "Merge #1319's refreshed head into issue/1316-hidden-swept-backstop\n\nThe swept backstop cells now hold #1303's span floors too: push_cells_with\nthreads `floors`, turn_hidden passes band_floors, so every ask stands no\nhigher than the span-floored exact-dip column #1319's grid backstop read.\nsweep.rs keeps band_floors/span_floor_at/pose_letters (POSE_FRACS restored)\nand drops backstop_columns/path_point; sweep_tests' pin ported to\nbackstop_asks with the same verdicts and exact reading.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
